 \end{eqnarray*}
imply $\bfy^*_{ T} =0$ and $\bfz^*_{\overline T}=0$. 
As a consequence of this and $\bfz^*_{\overline \Gamma_*}=0$ from \eqref{sta-eq-1-*}, 
\begin{eqnarray*}
